<https://cds.example/canon/synthesis/sebok-need>
    a cds:Synthesis ;
    dcterms:description "Rationale for the sebok-need reference record. SEBoK has no standalone 'Need' glossary term; it treats need within 'Stakeholder Needs and Requirements' (https://sebokwiki.org/wiki/Stakeholder_Needs_and_Requirements_(glossary)). That page could not be retrieved to quote verbatim (HTTP 403 to WebFetch; web.archive.org also unreachable), so the entry is a CITED PARAPHRASE, not a verbatim quote as originally requested." ;
    rdfs:label "SEBoK 'need' — reference entry, sourcing note" .
